entries[202610] = { ["name"] = "Dragonfire Bomb Dispenser", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUnique-Equipped\nTrinket\n+473 Agility\nUse: Stick a Dragonfire Bomb to your target, dealing 38559 Fire damage after 7 sec. If your target dies with a bomb attached, it deals 32132 split between all enemies within 10 yards instead. Stores a maximum of 3 bombs. (30 Sec Cooldown)\n\nCritically striking 60 times triggers a flash of inspiration, allowing you to assemble an extra Bomb charge on the fly. (5 Sec Cooldown)\nSell Price:" }
